# Folder synchronization, two-way (specs/003-folder-sync US6, US4). Run after 11-folder-sync.walk with the same server and folders: the reader folder Mirror still
# holds the files that walk downloaded from Books, the server holds the same names, and no pair exists any more - so every name is on both sides without a record, and
# a first sync of a two-way pair keeps both versions instead of choosing one. (The server's room and trash are restored first: walks 09 and 10 filled the account and
# removed the trash.)
# server quota 100000000000
# server trash
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeSync
waitfor syncEmpty No pairs yet
tap syncAdd
waitfor pairServerFolder
tap pairServerFolder
waitfor chooserRow
tap chooserRow 1
waitfor chooserPath Books
tap chooserChoose
waitfor pairServerFolder Books
tap pairReaderFolder
waitfor pickerPath
tap pickerRow 1
wait 500
tap pickerChooseFolder
waitfor pairReaderFolder Mirror
tap pairDirection 2
wait 300
expect pairDirection Two-way (selected)
shot @OUT@/110-pair-two-way.png
tap pairSave
waitfor dialogText can be sent to
shot @OUT@/111-send-confirm.png
tap footerButton 1
waitfor syncPairRow
# compare: nothing changes yet; the plan keeps both versions of every name that is on both sides
tap syncPairRow
wait 400
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor planTotals kept both
expect planKeepBothNote Both versions are kept
expect planRowCaption Keep both
shot @OUT@/112-plan-keep-both.png
tap planApprove
waitfor resultCounts kept both
shot @OUT@/113-result-kept-both.png
tap resultDone
waitfor syncPairRow
# the same sync again finds everything kept apart: nothing to transfer
tap syncPairRow
wait 400
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor planTotals skipped
shot @OUT@/114-plan-again.png
tap planCancel
waitfor syncPairRow
